      "title": "Eurorails Mayfair Games 1993 Gray Box #457 Railroad Strategy Board Game",
      "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#222;max-width:760px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px;\">Eurorails \u2014 Mayfair Games Gray-Box Edition</h2>\n<p>Build rail lines across Europe and earn money hauling freight in this crayon-rail strategy game from Mayfair\u2019s Empire Builder series.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:20px 0 8px;\">Condition</h3>\n<p>Pre-owned. The box shows corner and edge wear and creasing. Some map panels have light colored marks from play. Individual components have not been counted to verify completeness.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:20px 0 8px;\">Details</h3>\n<ul><li>Mayfair Games, gray-box edition with 1993 copyright</li><li>Mayfair no. 457, UPC 029877004577</li><li>English rules, 2\u20136 players</li></ul>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:20px 0 8px;\">Included</h3>\n<p>Original box and insert, interlocking map panels, printed rules, cards, paper money, freight tokens, pawns and crayons shown in the photos.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:20px 0 8px;\">Packing &amp; Shipping</h3>\n<p>The components will be secured in the tray, and the game box will be cushioned inside a shipping carton. Buyer-paid calculated USPS Ground Advantage shipping. Returns accepted within 30 days with buyer-paid return shipping.</p>\n</div>\n",
